, I<0 for DOWN), $5","new":"Same T entry rule, plus 2 consecutive polls where I > −0.25 for UP or I < +0.25 for DOWN, $5","reason":"Zero trades in ~26 hours even though T filled three times in that span. On all three of those T fills, top-of-book imbalance I was on the opposite side (or nearly flat), so a strict same-side I>0 / I<0 filter could never agree. Lowered the agreement floor from 0 to −0.25 / +0.25 and required 2 agreeing snapshots instead of 3. That would have allowed 2 of T’s 3 live trades (the UP fill at I=−0.25 would still be blocked). Expected rate approaches T’s when the book is not strongly opposed (T’s 18-day backtest is ~10 trades/day / +$115 at $5; live T has been quieter)."}],"coinbase_lag":{"reachable":true,"samples":900,"last_price":57703.84,"last_diff_bp":-1.9735,"mean_abs_bp":4.2307},"btc_minutes":{"as_of":"1:20:06 AM PT","source":"BRTI","last":57717.05,"series":[{"ts":1795249260,"t":"12:21 AM","c":57588.87,"d":-73.16,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795249320,"t":"12:22 AM","c":57563.8,"d":-25.07,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795249380,"t":"12:23 AM","c":57507.73,"d":-56.07,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795249440,"t":"12:24 AM","c":57561.11,"d":53.38,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795249500,"t":"12:25 AM","c":57622.93,"d":61.82,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795249560,"t":"12:26 AM","c":57569.72,"d":-53.21,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795249620,"t":"12:27 AM","c":57615.01,"d":45.29,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795249680,"t":"12:28 AM","c":57605.98,"d":-9.03,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795249740,"t":"12:29 AM","c":57588.74,"d":-17.24,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795249800,"t":"12:30 AM","c":57578.58,"d":-10.16,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795249860,"t":"12:31 AM","c":57537.42,"d":-41.16,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795249920,"t":"12:32 AM","c":57341.22,"d":-196.2,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795249980,"t":"12:33 AM","c":57307.32,"d":-33.9,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795250040,"t":"12:34 AM","c":57286.84,"d":-20.48,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795250100,"t":"12:35 AM","c":57386.78,"d":99.94,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795250160,"t":"12:36 AM","c":57328.11,"d":-58.67,"dir":"d